  "question": {
    "text": "Let a variable line passing through a fixed point <math><mi>P</mi></math> in the first quadrant cuts the positive coordinate axes at points <math><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><mi>B</mi></math> respectively. If the area of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is minimum, then <math><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
